WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.288 --> 00:00:12.816
It's common for sagging eyelids to cover the crease and make the eyes look smaller with age, but eye point makeup can still give you a nice, bright, defined look.

2
00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:19.416
Rather than just applying heavier makeup, we use special techniques that naturally lift sagging eyes upward,

3
00:00:19.752 --> 00:00:28.824
using various products to naturally correct sagging eyelids into a bigger, more defined shape, and also balance out the eye asymmetry most middle-aged people have.

4
00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:34.728
The goal isn't simply the biggest eyes possible, but an eye look that fits a wedding parent's refined, gentle image.

5
00:00:35.064 --> 00:00:40.920
If time pressure means the asymmetry gets overlooked, be sure to ask that both eyes be balanced.

6
00:00:41.256 --> 00:00:43.944
Don't let uneven eyes show up in your photos.
